otengine/godot/issues/104207","id":2727542588,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ikv88","user":{"login":"mbucchia","id":69611560,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NjExNTYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69611560?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia","html_url":"https://github.com/mbucchia","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-16T16:59:18Z","updated_at":"2025-03-16T17:00:33Z","body":"I am a little confused by your CI.\r\n\r\nThis workflow with latest push passed all green:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/mbucchia/godot/actions/runs/13881066387\r\n\r\nHowever the checks below in the PR reflect a CSS error. The details show the formatter replacing `#ifdef` inclusion guards with `#pragma` once.\r\n\r\nMeanwhile your CSS guide (https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/cpp_usage_guidelines.html#pragma-once-directive) says:\r\n\r\n> #pragma once directive\r\n> To follow the existing style, please use standard #ifdef-based include guards instead of #pragma once in new files\r\n\r\nWhat am I missing?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727542588/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":