,"created_at":"2025-04-20T03:42:07Z","updated_at":"2025-04-20T03:42:07Z","body":"Evidence that there is no delta between the two sets of commits:\r\n\r\n```\r\nPS D:\\XR\\godot> git diff  6f5522b..e3c215f\r\nPS D:\\XR\\godot>\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2816975047/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2816982453","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104207#issuecomment-2816982453","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104207","id":2816982453,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n5721","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-20T04:10:15Z","updated_at":"2025-04-20T04:10:15Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2816982453/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2817119415","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104207#issuecomment-2817119415","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104207","id":2817119415,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n6dS3","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-20T11:10:55Z","updated_at":"2025-04-20T11:10:55Z","body":"> I am not able to make my Intel ARC card work today\r\n\r\nI've had reports in the past that ARC is having difficulty with stereo rendering as is, if you have hardware that you can test at some point it be nice to know if things work with DirectX and ARC.\r\n\r\nBut don't see it as a reason not to merge, if there are issues we'd need to get Intel involved at some point, if they are willing.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2817119415/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2817301094","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104207#issuecomment-2817301094","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104207","id":2817301094,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n7Jpm","user":{"login":"mbucchia","id":69611560,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NjExNTYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69611560?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia","html_url":"https://github.com/mbucchia","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-20T19:14:21Z","updated_at":"2025-04-20T19:14:21Z","body":"> I've had reports in the past that ARC is having difficulty with stereo rendering as is, if you have hardware that you can test at some point it be nice to know if things work with DirectX and ARC.\r\n\r\nAlright, I assume it's a \"picture or it didn't happen\" moment :)\r\n\r\n![godot](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/612c0d40-60d9-47b6-a080-b197659b39f2)\r\n\r\n```\r\n[...]\r\n2025-04-20 12:10:59 -0700: Device is: Oculus Quest2 (20)\r\n2025-04-20 12:10:59 -0700: Recommended resolution: 2496x2592\r\n2025-04-20 12:11:18 -0700: Using Direct3D 12 on adapter: Intel(R) Arc(TM) A310 LP Graphics\r\n2025-04-20 12:11:18 -0700: Using D3D12 on adapter: Intel(R) Arc(TM) A310 LP Graphics\r\n2025-04-20 12:11:28 -0700: Creating a swapchain with texture array\r\n[...]\r\n```\r\n\r\nWorking great with ARC, latest driver. No issue with the view instancing.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2817301094/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2817312407","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104207#issuecomment-2817312407","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104207","id":2817312407,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n7MaX","user":{"login":"mbucchia","id":69611560,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NjExNTYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69611560?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia","html_url":"https://github.com/mbucchia","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbucchia/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-20T19:45:56Z","updated_at":"2025-04-20T20:22:41Z","body":"Amending my previous comment, I am getting a D3D layer error when running with the ARC. It could be sign of a real issue:\r\n\r\n> D3D12 ERROR: ID3D12CommandList::OMSetRenderTargets: The RenderTargetView at slot 0 is not compatible with the DepthStencilView. When D3D12_FEATURE_DATA_D3D12_OPTIONS19::MismatchingOutputDimensionsSupported is FALSE, DepthStencilViews may only be used with RenderTargetViews if the effective dimensions of the Views are equal, as well as the Resource types, multisample count, and multisample quality. One exception is that DepthStencil width and/or height can be larger than RenderTarget width/height.The RenderTargetView at slot 0 has (w:2496,h:2592,as:2), while the Resource is a Texture2D with (mc:1,mq:0). The DepthStencilView has (w:2496,h:2592,as:1), while the Resource is a Texture2D with (mc:1,mq:0).  [ EXECUTION ERROR #728: SET_RENDER_TARGETS_INVALID]\r\n\r\nThe call in question is in `RenderingDeviceDriverD3D12::command_next_render_subpass()` (I confirmed it is not a VR runtime issue).\r\n\r\nI'm thinking this is because the ARC driver doesn't support this `MismatchingOutputDimensionsSupported` while Nvidia does. That said, when you look at the details, things start to become odd:\r\n\r\nThe RenderTargetView at slot 0 has (w:2496,h:2592,as:2) [...]\r\nThe DepthStencilView has (w:2496,h:2592,as:1)\r\n\r\n~~This looks like a real issue where maybe we are not allocating depth buffer for stereo. I still recommend to proceed with merging this change, and I have filed a follow-up issue here: #105599.~~\r\n\r\nUPDATE: I have done the due diligence in #105599 and verified that we are not doing anything Wrong. Then I talked to the D3D team at Microsoft and they confirmed the bug is in the validation layer.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2817312407/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.g